"RaptorQ Forward Error Correction Scheme for Object Delivery". RFC 6330
contains code components owned by the IETF Trust. Under the copyright and
license notice in that document, code components extracted from it must include
the "Simplified BSD License" text (IETF Trust Legal Provisions, Section 4.e; the
IETF Trust clarified on 2021-09-21 that the "Simplified BSD License" referred to
